{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_01_end","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":3,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_01_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-1","storyName":"硬壳下的胆小鬼","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"梓兰和空爆完成了第一场狩猎，并遭遇了泡影国的大敌——“雷之主”。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_01_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":1,"next":3,"characters":["宝巫迦","梓兰","空爆","熔火蜗","“雷之主”","领头武士","随从武士们"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_bg_71_g4_bambooforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"两位就请在这里等待吧。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"前方就是熔火蜗集团出现的地点，这一次，交给吾来处理即可。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......真的不用我们帮忙？","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"若是连这点麻烦都处理不了，吾又有何资格挑战“雷之主”呢？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":22},{"type":"charslot","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_282_catap_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"l","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"......","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"r","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_282_catap_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，我真的有点迷糊了。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"难道那种发生在斑点看的漫画里的事真的发生在了我们身上？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......别急着下结论。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#4","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"十年一次的“试炼”“异兽”“异兽猎人”，还有那座跟这一切格格不入的“御轮”......这一切都有些刻意，你不觉得吗？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_char_278_orchid_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"r","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"还有泡普卡——","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_282_catap_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，你的意思是，这一切都是个骗局？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"还记得我们之前在萨尔贡吧？","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"萨尔贡的某些帕夏，常会因为太过无聊而在自己的领地中做一些匪夷所思的事，比如说，这里也有可能是一座处在绿洲中的巨大摄影棚。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":43},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"哇哦，我也想体验这种有钱人的生活——","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":45},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"呃，不对，要是这么说的话，我现在已经在体验了。","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_282_catap_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"但那三个人又要怎么解释呢？","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"r","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"帕夏的手下往往有许多能人异士，或许他们的认知被修改了。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_282_catap_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"为啥是他们？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"r","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你问我，我问谁，我只是提出一种可能性而已。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"r","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"如果是我想的这样，至少他们三个现在是安全的。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#5","focus":"r","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"但如果不是——","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":62},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":65},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"0.5","id":66},{"type":"charslot","id":67},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tense_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_tense_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":68,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_282_catap_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#5","focus":"l","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嗯？","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_282_catap_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"欸......梓兰姐，你不觉得这家伙......有点眼熟吗？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"r","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......大型源石虫？","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_282_catap_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哈，梓兰姐，我现在相信你说的这里是摄影棚这回事了！","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哪有这么巧的事！这里绝对有问题！","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"r","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"看来，我们必须制定一个策略。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":82},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"熔火蜗","text":"（大声的吼叫）","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2104_1$2.png"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":86},{"type":"charslot","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_282_catap_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"这家伙看来也想一起制定策略，梓兰姐。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"r","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"唉。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"charslot","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"false","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，你的伞还是不太行吗？","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我不知道究竟怎么了！","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"别跟它硬拼！它的动作很笨重，智力程度不高！","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"利用地形，把它引到那边的竹林！","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"明白！","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"嘿！大家伙！看这边！","id":108},{"type":"dialog","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":110},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"1","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":113},{"type":"charslot","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":116},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"就是现在！倒！","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":122},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_statuecollapse","volume":"1","id":123},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-50","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":126},{"type":"charslot","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"成功了！你看，梓兰姐！竹子把它压住了！","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"不对，小心！它要挣脱了！你看，那些竹子碰到它的岩浆壳就烧起来了！","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哇啊！它好像更生气了！它朝我们看过来了！","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"快散开！它要喷火了！","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"躲不开了！这一击的范围太大了！","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":138},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":139},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":140},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":141},{"type":"dialog","id":142},{"type":"charslot","id":143},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_skillroar_hyper","volume":"1","id":144},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":146},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_71_i01.png","fadetime":"0","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","id":147},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_71_i01","style":"cg","pfrom":"0,0","pto":"-400,0","layer":"1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"0","pduration":"0","id":148},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":149},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hyperpunch_hit1","volume":"1","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":151},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":152},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hyperpunch_hit1","volume":"1","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":154},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":155},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hyperpunch_hit1","volume":"1","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":157},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"6","block":"false","id":158},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$MHR_bat_monsterhunter2boss_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act50side/m_bat_monsterhunter2boss_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":159,"musicid":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":160},{"type":"text","text":"危急时刻，一声响彻天地的咆哮从不远处传来。","id":161},{"type":"text","text":"一头青色的巨大野兽，优雅地从林中漫步而出。","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"竹子如同积木一样倒下，像是臣服于君王的降临，又似在逃离鬼神的接近。","id":163},{"type":"text","text":"当月光终于照耀在它的身上时，一瞬间，周围的一切仿佛凝固，连心跳都仿佛静止了。","id":164},{"type":"text","text":"它头上的尖角恰似冠冕，在月光下闪烁着冷芒。","id":165},{"type":"text","text":"它的身躯，宛若夜色中沉睡的宝石，却又在每一次肌肉的鼓动间折射出碎裂的白光，仿佛万千闪电被囚禁在片片鳞甲下，急欲破壳而出。","id":166},{"type":"text","text":"当它阔步而来，大地先行震颤，每一次爪锋触及岩石，都激起蜿蜒电弧。长尾挥洒，电弧骤起，犹如新月撕开夜幕。","id":167},{"type":"text","text":"上一刻还让两人感到棘手的熔火蜗，在它的面前，竟显得有些可爱。","id":168},{"type":"dialog","id":169},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_skillroar_hyper","volume":"1","id":171},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalpunch_voice","volume":"1","id":172},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalpunch_echo","volume":"1","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":176},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"那......那是什么？我从来没见过这种生物——","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"这家伙......难道就是“雷之主”？！","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"居然只一击就把大型源石虫解决了......","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“雷之主”","text":"......","id":181},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"dialog","id":185},{"type":"image","id":186},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":188},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_bg_71_g4_bambooforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":190},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":191},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，看来它盯上我们了。交给我——","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"别恋战！","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘿，“雷之主”，尝尝这个！","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"playsound","key":"$grenade_launcher_shot","volume":"1","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-30,0","focus":"m","duration":"0.5","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":202},{"type":"playsound","key":"$grenade_launcher_shot","volume":"1","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-30,0","posto":"-60,0","focus":"m","duration":"0.5","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":205},{"type":"playsound","key":"$grenade_launcher_shot","volume":"1","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-60,0","posto":"-90,0","focus":"m","duration":"0.5","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":208},{"type":"charslot","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2102_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":211},{"type":"playsound","key":"$grenade_explosion","volume":"1","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":214},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":216},{"type":"playsound","key":"$grenade_explosion","volume":"1","id":217},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":219},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":221},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"70","randomness":"80","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":222},{"type":"playsound","key":"$grenade_explosion","volume":"1","id":223},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_sp_ballista","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":227},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalroar2","volume":"1","channel":"roar","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“雷之主”","text":"（低沉的吼叫）","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2102_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"......不可能，这家伙居然毫发无损！","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":233},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2102_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalpunch_jump","volume":"1","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":237},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalpunch_start","volume":"1","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-20,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":240},{"type":"charslot","id":241},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hyperpunch_hit1","volume":"1","id":242},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalpunch_start","volume":"1","id":243},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalpunch_echo","volume":"1","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":249},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"70","randomness":"80","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哇啊！","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"空爆！","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#5","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"啧......法术用不了，至少——","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2102_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":260},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":261},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalpunch_roar","volume":"1","id":262},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stinkbomb","volume":"0.7","id":263},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"1","g":"0.7","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"7","block":"false","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"7","id":266},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_jump_roar","volume":"1","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":268},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_jump","volume":"1","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":270},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_jump_voice","volume":"1","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":272},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":273},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":274},{"type":"charslot","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"空爆，你太莽撞了！","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"抱歉，梓兰姐......","id":279},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","posfrom":"0,-80","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":283},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":284,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"你刚才扔的是异臭弹吧？","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......之前逃跑的时候顺便捡了两颗，泡普卡说，对驱赶野兽有奇效，我就留了个心眼。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"不愧是梓兰姐！","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"不过，那就是“雷之主”啊......好厉害啊。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"下次再见到它，不准随便出手。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哦......","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"charslot","id":299},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":300},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"2","fadetime":"1.5","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":303},{"type":"multiline","name":"宝巫迦","text":"两位！吾刚才好像听到了“雷之主”的叫声，","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"multiline","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你们——","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"呃，嘿嘿。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我们和它短暂地交了手。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这太莽撞了，两位！","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐已经训过我啦。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"幸好两位平安无事......","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾已经将这一带的熔火蜗都清理掉了。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"找到“异兽”的踪迹了吗？","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......没有。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦，熔火蜗真的是这里的生物吗？","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"当然。熔火蜗一直是栖息在泡影国周边的野兽。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"但看它的样子不该是栖息在火山之类的地方吗，这里是竹林吧？","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"两位有所不知，“御轮”之下虽然是雪山，但雪山之下却是熔岩地带。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"那里正是熔火蜗栖息的地方。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":333},{"type":"charslot","id":334},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头武士","text":"陛下，我们可以开始打扫战场了吗？","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"去吧，这一带已经安全了。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头武士","text":"不愧是陛下！","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头武士","text":"感谢“御轮”的恩赐，感谢巫女的引导，我等泡影国的子民，将心怀敬意地使用这些神赐之物。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头武士","text":"将熔火蜗的尸体都搬回去，然后采集一切有用的素材。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"随从武士们","text":"是！","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stnecrve","volume":"1","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":356},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stnecrve","volume":"1","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"呃......他们在干什么？","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"熔火蜗平日生活在熔岩地带，很少成群出现，它的壳能够做成可以长时间燃烧的“火竹炭”。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头武士","text":"没错！这种“火竹炭”结实好用，但是熔火蜗太少见了，今天这一批的量，今年我们过冬都不用愁了。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"那那边在兴高采烈砍竹子的又是为什么......？","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头武士","text":"我们平时就会用竹子来制作各种东西，而熔火蜗的温度比国内最大的炉子都要高，能够将这些竹子烤得无比坚硬。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头武士","text":"这种熔火蜗烤好的竹子，我们称之为“烈竹”。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"领头武士","text":"用“烈竹”做成的武器也好，家具也好，都十分耐用。","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"有意思，我也来帮忙！","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......只有靠“试炼”才能获得这么多吗？","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是的。","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"每十年一次的“试炼”中出现的“异兽”，以及它掀起的异变，会对周边的环境造成很大影响。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"其中虽然有许多危机，但同时也为吾等带来了许多平时无法获得的东西。","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"因此，对泡影国来说，“试炼”是危机，也是机遇。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"狩地之兽，得天之赐，这正是泡影国的做法。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"m","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":386},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":387},{"type":"dialog","id":388},{"type":"charslot","id":389},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_bg_71_g4_bambooforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":390},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":391},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":392},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"将“试炼”造成的影响视作恩赐，甚至在生活上依靠这种恩赐，这未免太缺乏稳定性了。","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哦？这块烈竹的材质真不错，拿来做弹药的素材应该稳定性不错......","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#5","focus":"m","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"而且，他们难道从来没有想过深究这一切的原因吗？","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，大概是熔火蜗经过的原因，地上有好多烤焦的花花草草，有些味道闻起来还不错欸。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你到底有没有听我说话！","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我在听啊。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......我不相信他们的这套说辞，我们要想办法搞清楚这里究竟是什么地方。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"其实我觉得还挺说得通欸。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"那你留下吧。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"欸，我不是相信他们啦，只是我觉得这种生活方式没有梓兰姐你想象的那么说不通而已。","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"反正，源石虫这件事也太穿帮啦。","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"如果这里真的像梓兰姐你说的那样，是一座巨大摄影棚，或者帕夏的后花园啥的，就算我们要走，也得带上他们三个吧？","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我知道。接下来，我们分头行动。","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我去收集情报。你身手比我好，你去调查他们身上发生了什么。","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘿嘿，这个我喜欢！","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"记住，首要任务是调查，找到线索，不要冲动行事。我们的最终目的是解救同伴，并一起逃离这里。","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"明白了！","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":426},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":427},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":428},{"type":"bgeffect","id":429},{"type":"gridbg","id":430},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":431},{"type":"image","id":432},{"type":"charslot","id":433}],"characters":["宝巫迦","梓兰","空爆","熔火蜗","“雷之主”","领头武士","随从武士们"]}